      "description": "A financially motivated criminal gang targets a mid-sized Canadian energy company (~2500 employees) with the goal of achieving full Active Directory compromise, enabling ransomware deployment or data extortion. The intrusion begins with a phishing campaign targeting corporate email users, proceeds through credential theft and internal reconnaissance, and culminates in domain controller takeover via DCSync or similar AD abuse.",
